---
import { CATEGORIES } from '@/lib/mockData';
---

<article class="clay-box p-3.5 sm:p-8 md:p-10 my-6 sm:my-16 max-w-5xl mx-auto space-y-3 sm:space-y-6">
  <header class="border-b border-slate-200/80 pb-3 sm:pb-6 text-center md:text-left space-y-1.5 sm:space-y-2">
    <span class="inline-flex px-2.5 py-0.5 sm:px-3 sm:py-1 rounded-full text-[9px] sm:text-xs font-bold bg-pink-500/10 text-pink-600 border border-pink-500/20 uppercase tracking-wider">
      📘 Official Platform Guide
    </span>
    <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl md:text-3xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">
      Quick Questions, Clear Answers
    </h2>
    <p class="text-[11px] sm:text-sm font-semibold text-slate-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto md:mx-0">
      A lighter overview of how Instabid works before you place a bid.
    </p>
  </header>

  <div class="space-y-3 sm:space-y-4">
    <details class="clay-inset p-3 sm:p-4 md:p-5 rounded-2xl" open>
      <summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-black text-slate-800 text-xs sm:text-sm md:text-base flex items-center justify-between gap-3">
        <span class="pr-3 leading-snug">What is instabid.live?</span>
        <span class="text-pink-600 text-lg shrink-0">+</span>
      </summary>
      <div class="mt-3 text-[11px] sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed space-y-2">
        <p>
          instabid.live is a pay-to-rank Instagram leaderboard where creators and brands bid to appear higher in category-based rankings.
        </p>
        <p>
          The goal is simple: secure stronger visibility, attract more attention, and drive traffic to your Instagram profile through a cleaner and more transparent marketplace.
        </p>
      </div>
    </details>

    <details class="clay-inset p-3 sm:p-4 md:p-5 rounded-2xl">
      <summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-black text-slate-800 text-xs sm:text-sm md:text-base flex items-center justify-between gap-3">
        <span class="pr-3 leading-snug">How does bidding work?</span>
        <span class="text-pink-600 text-lg shrink-0">+</span>
      </summary>
      <div class="mt-3 text-[11px] sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed space-y-2">
        <p>
          Choose your category, verify your Instagram profile, and place a bid. Higher bids move you higher on the leaderboard for the current weekly season.
        </p>
        <p>
          You only pay the amount needed to claim the rank you want, and your profile remains active until your spot is outbid or the season resets.
        </p>
      </div>
    </details>

    <details class="clay-inset p-3 sm:p-4 md:p-5 rounded-2xl">
      <summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-black text-slate-800 text-xs sm:text-sm md:text-base flex items-center justify-between gap-3">
        <span class="pr-3 leading-snug">How is ownership verified?</span>
        <span class="text-pink-600 text-lg shrink-0">+</span>
      </summary>
      <div class="mt-3 text-[11px] sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed space-y-2">
        <p>
          We generate a short verification code and ask you to place it in your public Instagram bio temporarily.
        </p>
        <p>
          Once we confirm that code is live, the account is treated as verified and the bid can go live.
        </p>
      </div>
    </details>

    <details class="clay-inset p-3 sm:p-4 md:p-5 rounded-2xl">
      <summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-black text-slate-800 text-xs sm:text-sm md:text-base flex items-center justify-between gap-3">
        <span class="pr-3 leading-snug">Why is this different from a generic board?</span>
        <span class="text-pink-600 text-lg shrink-0">+</span>
      </summary>
      <div class="mt-3 text-[11px] sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed space-y-2">
        <p>
          Every listing is category-based, profile-led, and verification-backed instead of being a random list of unverified links.
        </p>
        <p>
          We keep the experience cleaner, more relevant, and easier to trust for creators, brands, and businesses looking for meaningful exposure.
        </p>
      </div>
    </details>

    <details class="clay-inset p-3 sm:p-4 md:p-5 rounded-2xl">
      <summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-black text-slate-800 text-xs sm:text-sm md:text-base flex items-center justify-between gap-3">
        <span class="pr-3 leading-snug">What categories are available?</span>
        <span class="text-pink-600 text-lg shrink-0">+</span>
      </summary>
      <div class="mt-3 text-[11px] sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-2.5 sm:gap-3 pt-1">
          {CATEGORIES.map((cat) => (
            <a
              href={`/category/${cat.slug}`}
              class="clay-box p-2.5 sm:p-3 flex items-center gap-2.5 sm:gap-3 hover:scale-[1.01] transition-transform group"
            >
              <span class="text-lg sm:text-xl shrink-0">{cat.icon}</span>
              <div class="min-w-0">
                <div class="font-bold text-[10px] sm:text-[11px] md:text-xs text-slate-800 group-hover:text-pink-600">{cat.name}</div>
                <div class="text-[9px] sm:text-[10px] text-slate-500 leading-snug">{cat.description}</div>
              </div>
            </a>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </details>

    <details class="clay-inset p-3 sm:p-4 md:p-5 rounded-2xl">
      <summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-black text-slate-800 text-xs sm:text-sm md:text-base flex items-center justify-between gap-3">
        <span class="pr-3 leading-snug">Is checkout secure?</span>
        <span class="text-pink-600 text-lg shrink-0">+</span>
      </summary>
      <div class="mt-3 text-[11px] sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed space-y-2">
        <p>
          Yes. Payments are processed through secure providers and all bids are treated as purchases for digital placement within the active weekly leaderboard season.
        </p>
        <p>
          Full policy details are available in our <a href="/terms" class="text-pink-600 font-bold hover:underline">Terms</a> and <a href="/privacy" class="text-pink-600 font-bold hover:underline">Privacy Policy</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </details>
  </div>

  <section class="text-center pt-1 sm:pt-2">
    <button id="open-bid-modal-btn" class="clay-btn-primary px-6 sm:px-8 py-3 sm:py-3.5 text-xs sm:text-sm font-black shadow-lg hover:scale-105 transition-transform mt-2 w-full sm:w-auto">
      Claim #1 Spot Now 🚀
    </button>
  </section>
</article>
